step Kodo Graveyard
  zone Desolace
  tip Use Smeed's Kodo Kombobulator on an Aged, Dying or Ancient Kodo in the graveyard and walk the tamed kodo back to Smeed, five times. Careful: leave the kodo skulls on the ground alone: opening one raises a Kodo Apparition (37-38) that hits hard.
  use 13892 @51.0,58.5 "Kodo Kombobulator" -- on an Aged, Dying or Ancient Kodo in the graveyard; don't kill it
  talk 4700 quest 5561.1 @60.6,61.6   -- the tamed kodo, at Smeed's camp: talk to it, five times

step Scrabblescrew's Camp
  zone Desolace
  turnin 5561                         -- Smeed Scrabblescrew

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The west coast

step Shadowprey Village
  zone Desolace
  tip Head west to the troll village on the coast, keeping clear of the Gelkis Village on the way. Aka'rai stands on the path just north of the village.
  tip Aka'rai may not be here on Forever: if Aka'rai doesn't offer Hate the Hatefury, skip it.
  accept 97265 optional               -- Aka'rai: the Hatefury satyrs of Sargeron, later in this guide
  sethome "Shadowprey Village"        -- Innkeeper Sikewa
  accept 5763                         -- Roon Wildmane: for Hemet Nesingwary in Stranglethorn, next guide
  accept 6142                         -- Mai'Lahii
  getfp "Shadowprey Village"          -- Thalon, at the village's south-west end

step Ethel Rethor
  zone Desolace
  tip Head north along the coast, then inland to the ruined tower of Ethel Rethor: Azore Aldamort waits inside. The coast's clams and naga come after Thunder Axe Fortress, on one walk north to Ranazjar Isle.
  accept 5741                         -- Azore Aldamort

step Thunder Axe Fortress
  zone Desolace
  tip Head east to Thunder Axe Fortress. Beat a Burning Blade cultist down, then use the Burning Gem on it before it dies to fill one Infused Burning Gem. The Burning Blade Seer stands on the fortress's top floor with the Sceptre. The cultists also drop a Flayed Demon Skin now and then (1-5%); if one drops, read it. Leave the red Hand of Iruxos Crystal for now: its Demon Spirit is 37, and the second Desolace visit comes back for it.
  collect 6435 quest 1435 @55.0,26.5
  collect 15750 quest 5741 @55.2,30.1 -- On the top floor
  collect 20310 x1 optional
  accept 1480 optional

step Ethel Rethor
  zone Desolace
  tip Back west to Azore.
  turnin 5741                         -- Azore Aldamort
  note Azore's next errand, the Book of the Ancients, needs Lord Kragaru (38) out on Ranazjar Isle: leave it, he is over your level.

step Rackmore's Log
  zone Desolace
  tip Rackmore's Log lies on the ground just south-west of Azore's tower, on the way down to the shore: read it. Its two keys drop only while you have the quest.
  accept 6161 object 177787           -- Rackmore's Log

step Clam beds
  zone Desolace
  tip West to the shore. Giant Softshell Clams lie in the shallows and the Enraged Reef Crawlers walk the beach: each clam you open on the sea floor, and some crawlers, give a Soft-shelled Clam. Open each one in your bags for its meat.
  tip The Drysnap Crawlers and Pincers on the same beach carry Rackmore's Silver Key, about one in seven.
  interact 177784 quest 6142.1 @30.6,31.9 map 1443 -- Giant Softshell Clams, on the sea floor
  use 15874 quest 6142.1 @30.6,31.9 map 1443 -- Soft-shelled Clam: open it in your bags
  collect 15924 quest 6142            -- Underwater
  collect 15878 quest 6161.1 @33.4,30.1 map 1443 -- Rackmore's Silver Key, from the Drysnap crabs

step Sar'theris Strand
  zone Desolace
  tip Keep north to Sar'theris Strand for Rackmore's Golden Key: any Slitherblade can drop it.
  tip Careful: the Myrmidons (34-35) hold the beach's northern half with the Sea Witches and Oracles (34-36, casters), up to two over you at 33: work the Naga and Sorceresses (32-33) of the southern half until the key drops, and leave the north for the second Desolace visit, at 38.
  collect 15881 quest 6161.2          -- Rackmore's Golden Key, from the Slitherblade naga

step Rackmore's Chest
  zone Desolace
  tip Swim out to Ranazjar Isle off the far northern tip: Rackmore's Chest stands on the shore beside the Serpent Statue. Open it with both keys; leave the statue alone.
  turnin 6161 @30.0,8.7 map 1443     -- Rackmore's Chest

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North-east

step Sargeron
  zone Desolace
  tip Head east past Thunder Axe Fortress and along the northern hills to the satyrs' ruins of Sargeron. Kill every kind you meet for Aka'rai; the Shadowstalkers walk unseen.
  tip Careful: Hatefury Rogues use Hide when they spawn, so they are stealthed until you find them.
  kill 4670 quest 1434.1
  kill 4672 quest 1434.2
  kill 4673 quest 1434.3
  kill 4675 quest 1434.4
  kill 4674 quest 97265.3 optional @75.28,20.33 map 1443 -- Hatefury Shadowstalker
  kill 4675 quest 97265.2 optional
  kill 4671 quest 97265.1 optional @77.94,24.1 map 1443 -- Hatefury Trickster, on the way south
  kill 4672 quest 97265.4 optional
  kill 4670 quest 97265.5 optional

step Khan Dez'hepah
  zone Desolace
  tip South to Kolkar Village. Khan Dez'hepah (35) walks among the tents on the east side with a Battle Lord or two (32-33): clear around him, then pull him alone at full health.
  tip Careful: Kolkar Battle Lords call nearby allies within 30 yd once they fall to 20% health.
  collect 6066 quest 1365

step Ghost Walker Post
  zone Desolace
  tip South-west down the road to the post.
  turnin 1434                         -- Takata Steelblade
  turnin 1435                         -- Maurin Bonesplitter
  turnin 1480 optional
  accept 1436                         -- Takata Steelblade: for Keldran in Orgrimmar, next guide
  note Takata's next errand sends you after a demon lord with an elite guard: skip it.
  turnin 1365                         -- Felgur Twocuts
  note Felgur now offers Centaur Bounty: the second Desolace visit, at 38, takes it on its way to the Valley of Spears.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Shadowprey

step Shadowprey Village
  zone Desolace
  tip West to Shadowprey: your hearthstone is bound there.
  turnin 97265 npc 268705 optional    -- Aka'rai, on the path just north of the village
  turnin 6142                         -- Mai'Lahii
  note Taiga's Hand of Iruxos, Drulzegar's Other Fish to Fry and Desolace's other 37-40 quests wait for the second visit, at 38: the next guides fly to Orgrimmar and take the zeppelin to Stranglethorn Vale.
